          </row>
        </tabular>
      </table>
      <ol marker="a.">
        <li>
          <p>
            Compare South Central Florida’s July monthly normal to Southwest North Dakota’s July monthly normal. Which climate division has July temperatures that vary more from the 30-year average? Why?
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>
            Is a temperature of 79.7℉ more unusual for Northeast Arizona or for Southeast Desert Basins California? Explain. 
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
